'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Crops|Fruit Tree]] seed that takes 28 days to grow into a [[Money Tree]], after which it will produce one [[Money Bag]] each day year round .

Saplings cannot be purchased. They can be obtained by chopping down existing Money Trees or as a rare drop from digging up [[Stardew:Artifact Spot|Artifact Spots]].

